// ...and the message and choice windows (FUN_0027d0f0, FUN_00280420), which step their text and cursor once per update and
// return early when the timestep is below 1: at 60 FPS pass them 1 and 0 on alternate frames (0x815F6 is the toggle, the
// timestep goes in 0x815E8). They read button presses (0x496ad0), so presses from a skipped frame are collected in 0x815F0
