// The world map (FUN_00168f00, a coroutine) steps its logic (FUN_0020cf20) once per update without a timestep: set 0x815FC
// so that it runs at 60 FPS, and 0x815FA, which becomes 0x815F9 like 0x815FC becomes 0x815F8, to halve its steps below.
// Its effects, map animation, motion interpolators (the camera) and 2D layers use the timesteps already halved above.
patch=1,EE,00168FB8,word,0C0206D8   // jal 0x81b60
