// Menus (FUN_0021f160, a coroutine) cover the screen with an opaque background, but the field is still drawn under them
// every frame: at 60 FPS that took over a field's time on the EE and made PCSX2's GS thread fall behind (thousands of
// draws). The menu's loop runs before the field each frame: set 0x811F0 before it draws and clear it when the loop ends,
// and skip the field's draw (FUN_001eaa70) while it's set.
