// The play time and the time since boot (0x4a7e04, 0x4a7e08; FUN_001f96c0) tick a second every 30 updates (the update counter at gp-0x7a6c), which at 60 FPS is half a
// second. Count vsyncs instead in 0x813C0, which FUN_001392d0 (sceGsSyncV, which the frame waits on) increments, and tick
// every 60 of them.
patch=1,EE,001392E0,word,080204F1   // j 0x813c4 (was sb v0,-0x7b74(gp))
